{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English support was added on October 29, 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Some text is in Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Birds and Nuts&quot; is a game where you move the bird left and right to drop nuts. If you match 3 or more nuts of the same type, they will disappear. Challenge yourself to keep matching nuts in a variety of situations, such as rolling nuts and birds that get in your way. Various birds will appear in all 100 stages.  Budgies, cockatiels, lovebirds, pigeons, ducks, sparrows, etc.  There was once a world filled only with birds. In the world of birds, the game of dropping nuts from a high place was popular.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game has been designed to be easy enough for even small children and those who don't usually play games to enjoy. This game is not designed for those seeking a high level of difficulty or the exhilaration of a puzzle game. It is suitable for those who want to enjoy a light game while watching the birds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/67e61c4d2cf71fe6b61a35f22b41c06e.poster.avif?t=1762907849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/67e61c4d2cf71fe6b61a35f22b41c06e.webm?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/67e61c4d2cf71fe6b61a35f22b41c06e.mp4?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls and Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply move the bird left and right to line up three or more nuts of the same type to clear them. The target number is displayed on the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/f79f7a63fa5d6333d04e175d08495439.poster.avif?t=1762907849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/f79f7a63fa5d6333d04e175d08495439.webm?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/f79f7a63fa5d6333d04e175d08495439.mp4?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different stages, including shrines, rivers, and beaches, are featured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/2acf969552205a736c592ac892b3f785.poster.avif?t=1762907849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/2acf969552205a736c592ac892b3f785.webm?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/2acf969552205a736c592ac892b3f785.mp4?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interfering Birds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, birds will interfere, making it harder to match nuts. 104 different bird species appear in &quot;Birds and Nuts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/729879e3c090f0977889e2b6034ac886.poster.avif?t=1762907849\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/729879e3c090f0977889e2b6034ac886.webm?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/extras/729879e3c090f0977889e2b6034ac886.mp4?t=1762907849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Bosses Appear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss appears every 10 stages. The boss's interference is extremely powerful, blowing away all the nuts you've lined up in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Birds Appearing&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Budgerigars, Cockatiels, Lovebirds, Pigeons, Ducks, Sparrows, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Worldview&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a world of birds. In the bird world, a popular game was to drop nuts from high places.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394900?t=1762907849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394900?t=1762907849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/d4f2bfe95f0fd3dc15447dc3a7cc8ded7ced72fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762907849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394900/d4f2bfe95f0fd3dc15447dc3a7cc8ded7ced72fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762907849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null